Subject: [PATCH 04/12] ps4: network and FFmpeg translators

Prefer IPv4 DNS, tune curl sockets and retries, initialise curl lazily, and apply the FFmpeg socket/DNS/TLS patches. The demuxer sets reconnect and probe defaults for HLS.
